WEBVTT

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.450
Hagiwara, the ropes! Get to the ropes!

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.350
Owww...!

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.870
Give... up...!

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.580
Sakura Hagiwara gives up again!

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.710
This marks her tenth
straight loss from her debut!

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:08.920
She's stuck in a death spiral of losses!

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:13.970
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:17.140
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:25.770
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:39.030
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:44.540
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:50.170
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:55.220
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:55.430 --> 00:02:00.760
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:06.140
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:09.020
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:15.700
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:18.410
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:21.620
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:26.710
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:29.540
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.630
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:40.140
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:48.230
Episode 03: Give Up!

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:49.180
Super-cute, super-cute, Sa-ku-ra!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.310
What's wrong? Where's your spirit?

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.440
Sakura-<i>chan...</i>

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.570
I wonder how much longer
she's going to continue wrestling.

00:02:57.770 --> 00:03:01.400
Sakura-<i>chan</i> said
until she beats Rio Kazama...

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:05.870
Before Rio Kazama, she
hasn't won at all since her debut.

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:08.030
There were a lot of fans at first...

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:10.540
...but now, aside from us,
there's only a handful, right?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.870
Honestly, it's too brutal to watch already.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:14.870
But that's why we have to...

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:18.090
To add, the Sakura-<i>chan</i> now...

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:21.920
...feels a lot different
from when she was in Sweet Diva.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:23.170
Different?

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:25.800
She gives up so easily now.

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:30.060
I liked the Sakura-<i>chan</i> who
had that "never give up" attitude.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.060
Seeing how she is now...

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:36.400
makes me wonder if our
cheers are really getting to her.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.150
H-Hey!

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:43.860
Sorry, but I'll hold off
going to the matches for a while.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:49.870
In the blue corner,
we have the dancing top idol!

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.580
The eternal center position!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:57.130
Hagiwara... Sakura!

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.540
Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.310
Ouch...!

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:13.770
Owww...!

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:18.810
This isn't anything like the
move I took when I first faced Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:23.190
I... can't take a second of this any longer!

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.990
This is the professional ring...

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.610
This is...!

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.030
Hagiwara!

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:34.160
Give... up...!

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:44.590
The pain...!

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:50.720
Give up...

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:01.020
Give up.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.660
Give up....!

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:39.520
"Performance Stadium"

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:47.530
Digger Yamamoto                            Toyoda Misaki

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:51.450
An amazing crowd, as usual
when Misaki's part of a main event.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:57.120
The first match is Sakura-<i>chan,</i>
who has lost forty-five times in a row...

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:16.890
No...!

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.690
C'mon... Not this again...

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:25.730
Bend back!

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.070
C'mon, bend!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.690
Bend, bend!

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.990
G-Give up...!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.620
Quit with the nonsense already!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.750
How much longer are you planning to lose?!

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:48.210
What?! Sakura-<i>chan</i> did her best out there!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.420
She keeps losing the
same way. It's stale, man!

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:53.970
She doesn't have
the will to win, man!

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.350
Stop messing with wrestling!

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:02.480
Sakura-<i>chan</i>, don't be too hard on your self!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:03.980
Sakura!

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:05.770
Hagiwara!

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:11.240
There it is! Kazama's favorite, sleeper hold!

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.200
This is going to be tough on Suzumoto!

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:16.530
I started pro wrestling
wanting to beat Rio-<i>san...</i>

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:19.080
Stop messing with wrestling!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:24.790
But I can't even satisfy
the audience who are watching.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.710
Is it okay for me to continue wrestling?

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.800
Hagiwara! Misaki-<i>san</i>'s
main event is gonna start!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.970
Hurry and get to the corner!

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:34.590
Y-Yes!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:38.300
We will now be holding today's main event!

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:42.680
The BWQ single title match has come!

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:48.440
First our challenger, making
her appearance, Digger Yamamoto!

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:48.860
"League of Evil"

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:09.000
Next making her appearance
is the champion, Toyoda Misaki!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.880
"Toyoda Misaki"

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.920
Misaki-<i>san</i>, you're the best!

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:16.800
Toyoda...!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:21.470
Misaki! Misaki! Misaki!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:24.060
W-Wow...!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:31.110
To the red corner, we
have the striking fighting artist!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:37.030
Champion, Toyoda Misaki!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.220
What's the matter, champ?!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.720
Not lookin' too good, are you?!

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:05.100
Toyoda-<i>san</i>!

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.890
She opened going rough already?

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:10.360
Digger must be really serious today.

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.740
Take this!

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.620
How about this?!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.590
Toyoda, give up?

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:41.760
No...!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:44.810
Here's the next one!

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:47.140
C'mon, get up here!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.270
This is the League of Evil's specialty...

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:54.480
...the Nightmare Quint Hold!

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.570
Damn it!

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.280
That's... not fair!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.530
A one versus five!

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:07.500
There's no way anyone can beat that...

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.340
Toyoda-<i>san</i>'s eyes...

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:16.840
...aren't showing any
signs of giving up yet!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:18.340
Pretty stubborn...

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:22.300
But, this is the end!

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.020
Not gonna let that by!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.520
I'm not sitting around any longer!

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.690
Hagiwara! You grab that one!

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.320
Yes!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.820
Toyoda-<i>san</i>! Now is your chance!

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:49.290
There it is! Misaki's move!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.580
The Misaki Special!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:52.710
One...!

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:54.420
Two...!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:56.040
Three!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.550
You did it! Toyoda!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:04.890
Misaki-<i>san</i>! You're the best!

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:06.720
Toyoda!

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.600
Wow...

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.730
I can't believe she won like that...

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:14.770
What'd you expect?
Misaki-<i>san</i> is Berserk's ace.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.400
Yes...

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:21.280
This is a professional wrestler!

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.530
I need to become more like Toyoda-<i>san</i>!

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:36.390
"5 consecutive weeks in first place!"

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:40.150
"47 Prefectures"
"Live concert set!"

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:14.300
"Handshake Event"

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:16.010
Thank you.

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:19.600
Thank you very much!

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:22.190
Thanks!

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:26.400
Thank you very much.

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:37.410
It's the Boston Crab hold!

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:41.120
This is the same
pattern as usual for Hagiwara!

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:18.120
Everyone! Today was the best!

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:20.660
Let's all get together again!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:30.010
Give... up....

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:34.970
Hagiwara Sakura, defeated again!

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.850
Fifty losses in a row since her debut now!

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:41.930
She's updated the
worst record in Berserk history!

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:44.940
Sakura-<i>chan...</i>

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:47.110
Give it up all ready!

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:48.900
Hey, quit!

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:51.110
This is no playground for an idol!

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:53.450
Get out!

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:00.910
Sakura-<i>chan...</i>

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:13.510
I've caused trouble to everyone
to give pro wrestling a shot...

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.720
I'm going to go pro!

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:19.220
I'll become a professional
wrestler and beat you!

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:24.230
Our pride as idols... as the Sweet Divas.

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:26.020
But...

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:28.940
...I'm not doing anything.

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:33.610
"Hagiwara Sakura updates her losing record!!"

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:35.650
"Shameful"   "50 consecutive losses!!"

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:43.370
I can't do this...

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:46.580
I'm scared of going back in the ring!

00:14:56.050 --> 00:15:06.800
Miyazawa Elena

00:14:57.050 --> 00:15:00.260
But... if I run now...

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:03.970
...no one in Sweet Diva,
or any of the fans...

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:06.890
...will welcome me back.

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:11.900
Even if I quit pro wrestling...

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:15.110
...there's nowhere for me to go back to.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:25.750
Alright, your last one!

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:27.370
Yes!

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:32.500
Suzumoto, where's Hagiwara?

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:33.590
Huh?

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:37.220
Oh, come to think of it, I haven't seen her.

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:39.130
I wonder where she is?

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:40.960
Letter of Resignation

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:43.720
President's Room

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:46.060
Even if I have nowhere to go...

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:51.060
everyone should be fine
with me just being a normal girl.

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:52.190
I...

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:54.150
Hagiwara-<i>san</i>?

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:57.690
Toyoda-<i>san</i>?

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:00.990
Is anything the matter?

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:03.490
Was today your day for training?

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:06.910
I came to prep for tomorrow's match.

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:08.750
Oh, I-I see.

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:11.790
Um, well I have to go now...

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:15.050
Say, can I ask you a favor?

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:18.470
Can you be my sparring partner tonight?

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:20.090
Huh?

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:24.470
But, I'm not fit to be
your partner, Toyoda-<i>san...</i>

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:28.310
It's not like we're
going to have a serious match.

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:32.350
Think of it as an
extension to our usual training.

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:34.400
But...

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:39.440
Okay. I hope I work.

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:41.820
Great. Thank you.

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:51.750
Okay then, let's get started.

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:54.130
Yes! Please!

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:07.220
She's strong!

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:10.730
Power won't work!
Then I'll use my moves!

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.570
She came back with the same move?!

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.200
How's this then?!

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:30.830
She shouldn't be able to get out of this!

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.630
It... It hurts!

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:47.850
She's way stronger!

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:51.100
All she's doing is returning
the same moves I made!

00:17:57.940 --> 00:17:59.730
The pain...!

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:05.320
M-My back...!

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:42.280
I... I can't get out...!

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:45.490
My body feels like it's going to tear!

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:52.950
Ouch...!

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:08.050
M-My hips are going to break!

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:15.180
O-Ouch!

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:18.900
It... It can't be?!

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:36.000
The Boston Crab hold, again?

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.750
Toyoda-<i>san</i> too?!

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:41.040
No more...

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:45.130
No more Boston Crab holds!

00:19:53.180 --> 00:19:55.470
O-Owww...!

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:06.780
It hurts!

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:09.700
This one hurts the most!

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:13.240
I'm no good after all...

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:15.990
The pain... I can't move!

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:18.080
I'm not good enough!

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:30.930
Sorry...

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:33.890
I'm sorry, everyone...

00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:41.600
I...

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:44.520
...couldn't do anything.

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:50.450
I couldn't... achieve anything.

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:54.490
Good bye, pro wrestling...

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:59.910
Good bye... Sweet Diva...!

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:13.470
I... give up...!

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:18.010
There's no such thing as giving up.

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:19.770
Huh...?

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:23.270
The only ones here are me and you.

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:26.610
There's no referee and this isn't a match.

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:30.490
If you don't want your back
broken, do something yourself.

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:32.240
No...!

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:43.830
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:46.580
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:51.340
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:54.220
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:03.890
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:09.520
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:22:09.730 --> 00:22:14.990
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:19.030
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:22:19.240 --> 00:22:20.160
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:22.830
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:25.500
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:32.880
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:22:33.090 --> 00:22:39.010
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:22:39.220 --> 00:22:40.220
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:22:40.430 --> 00:22:41.850
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:49.940
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:51.570
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:22:51.770 --> 00:22:55.530
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:55.740 --> 00:22:56.780
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:56.990 --> 00:22:58.320
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:58.530 --> 00:23:00.830
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:23:01.030 --> 00:23:02.290
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:23:02.490 --> 00:23:05.870
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:08.710
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:23:11.400 --> 00:23:36.010
Episode 04: This Is Pro Wrestling!

00:23:11.590 --> 00:23:14.880
Chief! Training's the thing! Training!

00:23:15.090 --> 00:23:18.010
To get stronger,
and in the name of sports...

00:23:18.220 --> 00:23:21.050
...training is needed after all!

00:23:21.260 --> 00:23:25.600
With Misaki's sparring,
Sakura-<i>chan</i> should grasp something.

00:23:25.810 --> 00:23:28.810
I expect her first win to come soon!

00:23:29.020 --> 00:23:31.230
Sweet Diva may be concerning, but...

00:23:31.440 --> 00:23:32.940
...now's the time to do your stuff!

00:23:33.150 --> 00:23:35.860
Sakura-<i>chan</i>! Go at it!

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:41.020
A request from Sakura:

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:41.020
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
